\title{SticsREval: Evaluate and Compare STICS Crop Model Versions}
\description{
Provides a streamlined workflow for evaluating the performance of the STICS crop model and comparing versions. Given a candidate version of STICS, the package runs simulations, compares the outputs against field observations and against statistics from a reference model version, and flags variables or simulation units (USMs) where performance has deteriorated. Results are stored in Apache Arrow/Parquet format and can be exported as CSV files and diagnostic plots. Relies on 'SticsOnR' for running simulations, 'SticsRFiles' for reading input and output data, and 'CroPlotR' for computing statistical criteria and generating plots.
